      <PointerOffset>271188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール～……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru~...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一体、何だったんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the heck
was that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ？　ね、エト？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I dunno... Do you
have any idea, Ethos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、えっと……
ぼくも……よくわかんない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-Umm... I don't...
really know, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、なんかこの子は
不思議な力を持ってるのかも
しれない、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, &lt;Couleur&gt; might
possess some kind
of mysterious power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまえ、本当、一体、
なにもんなんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, so, what even
*are* you, exactly?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
